,"transliteration":{"text":"dhālika"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَضْلُ","location":"62:4:2","transliteration":{"text":"faḍlu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","location":"62:4:3","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِيهِ","location":"62:4:4","transliteration":{"text":"yu'tīhi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَن","location":"62:4:5","transliteration":{"text":"man"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","location":"62:4:6","transliteration":{"text":"yashāu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","location":"62:4:7","transliteration":{"text":"wal-lahu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ذُو","location":"62:4:8","transliteration":{"text":"dhū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","location":"62:4:9","transliteration":{"text":"l-faḍli"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","location":"62:4:10","transliteration":{"text":"l-ʿaẓīmi"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٤","location":"62:4:11","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Bu, Allah'ın dilediğine verdiği lütfüdür. Allah, büyük lütuf sahibidir.","transliteration":"dhālika faḍlu l-lahi yu'tīhi man yashāu wal-lahu dhū l-faḍli l-ʿaẓīmi"},{"id":5182,"verse_key":"62:5","verse_number":5,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَثَلُ","location":"62:5:1","transliteration":{"text":"mathalu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","location":"62:5:2","transliteration":{"text":"alladhīna"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"حُمِّلُوا۟","location":"62:5:3","transliteration":{"text":"ḥummilū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","location":"62:5:4","transliteration":{"text":"l-tawrāta"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","location":"62:5:5","transliteration":{"text":"thumma"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَمْ","location":"62:5:6","transliteration":{"text":"lam"}},{"char_typ